# Azure Batch Data Engineering
# End-to-End Batch Data Engineering Project on Azure

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates an end-to-end batch data engineering solution using Azure Data Factory, Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2, Azure Databricks, Delta Lake, and GitHub.

The solution ingests data from multiple sources, stores it in a data lake, transforms it using PySpark, and organizes it into Bronze, Silver, and Gold layers.

## Architecture

```text
Data Sources
  ├── REST API (JSONPlaceholder Posts API)
  ├── Azure SQL Database (Customers)
  └── CSV File (Sales)
          |
          v
Azure Data Factory
  Data Ingestion and Orchestration
          |
          v
ADLS Gen2 - Landing Layer
          |
          v
Azure Databricks + PySpark
          |
          v
Bronze Layer - Raw Data in Delta Format
          |
          v
Silver Layer - Cleaned and Deduplicated Data
          |
          v
Gold Layer - Aggregated Business Data
          |
          v
GitHub - Source Control
```

## Technology Stack

- Azure Data Factory (ADF)
- Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2 (ADLS Gen2)
